      "description": "Clarinetta Unicase is a playful variation of the standard Clarinetta family, designed for designers who want to push beyond conventional letterforms. Unicase features small capitals—letters that share the height of their uppercase counterparts, creating a lighthearted, unconventional appearance. This creates a distinctly playful color and texture on the page, making it particularly well-suited for logotypes, headlines, and other display uses where visual impact and personality matter as much as readability. While maintaining Clarinetta's essential DNA—the elegant serifs, high contrast, and sophisticated construction—Unicase offers a fresh twist that breaks free from typographic convention.",
