      "designer": "Jürgen Huber",
      "description": "Clarinetta is an elegant serif typeface that embraces a classical concept—but interprets it boldly for contemporary use. The family is built on deliberately pronounced serifs and a striking contrast that commands attention, bringing a modern edge to time-honored typographic principles. The real maverick is the Ultra weight: so bold that its serifs actually touch, virtually standing on their feet in a delightfully uncompromising display of graphic confidence. The italic complements this with a classical, flowing stroke that adds movement and dynamism to any setting.\nDesigned for comprehensive language support, it offers the full Latin Extended character set.",
